        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.1. 安装"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                561,
                250,
                581
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "第一步：双击安装包，启动安装程序，若杀毒软件或防火墙弹出警告，请允许安装程序运行或将安装程序添加到白名单。点击“下一步”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                605,
                852,
                642
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/fcaa03516dbbc2667ab6525ac818e0b5988fc677cdb86cc5b74b81b1df534f85.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "第二步：选择安装路径后，并点击“安装”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                295,
                648,
                737,
                872
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
