        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "第三步：等待安装完成。"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                326,
                373,
                343
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/9f3c8098a033e60338c3019b6655ba3e61bdc1053547289bff10b05f23f3d580.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                295,
                350,
                737,
                576
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "第四步：若安装过程中出现如下图所示的提示框，代表在本次安装之前，机器中已经安装过ZRDDS，此次安装会替换关于 ZRDDS的环境变量。点击”确定”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                587,
                850,
                623
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/8210a0b00c5e335ebb806a45aaecc330bd43f1fae7f9d2c5d0cb79d37f4902ea.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                299,
                629,
                734,
                783
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "第五步：安装程序会在系统中设置环境变量，为了使环境变量起效，需要重新启动计算机，用户在使用 ZRDDS之前重启即可。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                809,
                852,
                845
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/8ea34ee9549483a70713a1422b97183a0bc3c6a7549577fff857bca9d80f6717.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "第六步：安装完后，点击“完成”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                366,
                91,
                667,
                243
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/2390608ebb936f12992429669e501e2eb4660e0efbac3664060d03030c7a3a2c.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "至此，臻融数据分发服务DDS系统软件已经成功安装到计算机上。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                295,
                278,
                736,
                502
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.2. ZRDDS 授权文件获取步骤"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                554,
                457,
                574
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 双击运行安装目录/bin/LicenceInfoUtil.exe 获取授权信息；"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                601,
                655,
                618
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 运行成功将会有提示，将同一目录的 zrddsregInfo.txt 或二维码 zrddsregInfo.bmp 发送给臻融软件科技有限公司；"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                625,
                852,
                664
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 接收臻融软件科技有限公司生成的授权文件zrddslicence.lic；"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                671,
                680,
                687
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 将授权文件放在ZRDDS安装目录或者ZRDDS运行程序同一目录即可完成ZRDDS应用授权；"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                694,
                850,
                733
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 授权文件仅能够在获取授权信息的那台机器上面使用。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                740,
                638,
                757
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.3. 创建数据类型支持文件"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                784,
                436,
                804
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "由于 DDS 中允许用户使用自定义的数据类型进行数据发布和订阅，因此需要用户在使用 DDS 编写应用程序前定义所使用的数据类型。数据类型通过 IDL 文件定义，IDL 文件具体格式见ZRDDS用户手册第3 章。IDL文件编写完成后，需要使用到安装目录中bin目录下的zrddsgen.exe 进行编译，生成支持文件。zrddsgen.exe 通过命令行运行，需要使用 Windows中的命令提示符进入到其目录下运行，通常情况下的运行参数如下："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                829,
                853,
                903
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "algorithm",
            "content": {
                "algorithm_caption": [],
                "algorithm_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "假定用户定义的数据类型名称为 Foo，使用 zrddsgen.exe 生成的支持文件总共有五个，分别为：Foo.java、FooDataRreader.java、FooSeq.java、FooDataWriter.java、FooTypeSupport.java。使用zrddsgen.exe 生成的支持文件可以使用在所有ZRDDS支持的操作系统上。"
                    }
                ],
                "algorithm_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                160,
                848,
                216
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                85,
                672,
                102
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "algorithm",
            "content": {
                "algorithm_caption": [],
                "algorithm_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "zrddsgen.exe –i [inputFile] –d [outputDir] –l java"
                    }
                ],
                "algorithm_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                142,
                104,
                684,
                121
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "其中[inputFile]替换为用户的 IDL 文件，[outputDir]替换为支持文件输出的目录。更多参数的信息见ZRDDS用户手册第3 章。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                124,
                850,
                159
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.4. 配置工程"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                240,
                297,
                260
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "在Windows平台上，臻融数据分发服务DDS支持多种IDE，此处以eclipse为例"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                285,
                794,
                303
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.4.1. 创建工程"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                324,
                295,
                343
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 单击 File。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                369,
                297,
                386
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 单击 New。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                392,
                304,
                409
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 选择 Java Project，填写项目名，创建一个工程。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                414,
                586,
                431
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/bc591fa1cbffc03300ac20be256afae5ff72cee3521fbace167180cdc4c2d85d.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                221,
                436,
                631,
                840
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 将 zrddsgen.exe 生 成 的 文 件 添 加 到 工 程 （ Foo.java 、 FooDataRreader.java 、FooDataWriter.java、FooSeq、FooTypeSupport.java）。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                847,
                842,
                888
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.4.2. 配置链接库"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                92,
                314,
                110
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.4.2.1. 链接 ZRDDS_JAVA.jar"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                140,
                396,
                158
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 右键工程->properties->Java Bulid Path->Libraries 选择 Add External JARS…，选择安装目录下的 ZRDDS_JAVA.jar 文件。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                179,
                184,
                852,
                223
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/0315a7b896bcef6b48052fb1fcb064cf2099687634d5e50be979a1fcada43bda.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                149,
                227,
                847,
                596
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.4.2.2. 链接动态库 ZRDDS_JAVA.dll"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                620,
                457,
                638
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 右键工程->properties->Java Bulid Path->Source，展开工程目录，双击 Native librarylocation，External Folder…，选择安装目录下的 lib 目录。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                664,
                852,
                705
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/0b7ccfc281d8f1407bccb6e5a810332868e6dca4d4c8e7d55309a27aa515dbc5.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                149,
                85,
                848,
                455
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.4.3. 运行"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                479,
                253,
                497
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "直 接 添 加 main 函 数 或 者 使 用 编 译 器 –e 命 令 生 成 的 Foo_publication.java 或 者Foo_subscriber.java 编译运行即可。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                520,
                850,
                556
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.5. 命令行编译运行"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                580,
                366,
                600
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "使用 zrddsgen.exe 生成文件（Foo.java、FooDataRreader.java、FooDataWriter.java、FooSeq、FooTypeSupport.java，Foo_publication.java）。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                629,
                840,
                669
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 使用java 编译，将编译输出至文件夹 out下："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                205,
                696,
                589,
                713
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "javac –cp 安装目录/lib/ZRDDS_JAVA.jar –d out *.java"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                721,
                603,
                738
            ]
        },
        {
